WEBVTT

00:00:08.865 --> 00:00:10.805
<v><b>Julia:</b></v> So who’s that with you?

00:00:11.718 --> 00:00:15.110
<v><b>Sarah:</b></v> It’s Anna, you know, the intelligent girl.

00:00:15.770 --> 00:00:20.589
<v><b>Julia:</b></v> Anna, wow! She’s very different.

00:00:21.375 --> 00:00:22.708
Her hair’s blonde.

00:00:23.201 --> 00:00:26.090
<v><b>Sarah:</b></v> Yes, and she doesn’t wear glasses now.

00:00:28.037 --> 00:00:29.050
<v><b>Julia:</b></v> What does she do?

00:00:30.445 --> 00:00:32.172
<v><b>Sarah:</b></v> She’s a journalist.

00:00:32.705 --> 00:00:36.664
She works for a newspaper – <i>The Times</i>, I think.

00:00:38.896 --> 00:00:40.105
<v><b>Julia:</b></v> Is she good?

00:00:41.078 --> 00:00:43.170
<v><b>Sarah:</b></v> I don’t know. I don’t read <i>The Times</i>.

00:00:46.258 --> 00:00:47.131
<v><b>Julia:</b></v> And who’s that?

00:00:47.845 --> 00:00:49.258
The man with grey hair.

00:00:50.385 --> 00:00:52.520
<v><b>Sarah:</b></v> It’s Matt! Remember?

00:00:53.178 --> 00:00:55.240
<v><b>Julia:</b></v> Matt! No!

00:00:56.123 --> 00:00:57.370
What does he do?

00:00:57.737 --> 00:01:00.418
<v><b>Sarah:</b></v> He’s a teacher. He teaches French.

00:01:01.604 --> 00:01:02.704
<v><b>Julia:</b></v> Where does he work?

00:01:03.504 --> 00:01:05.581
<v><b>Sarah:</b></v> At our old school.

00:01:06.688 --> 00:01:10.213
<v><b>Julia:</b></v> At our old school? How sad!

00:01:10.214 --> 00:01:13.272
<v><b>Sarah:</b></v> Yes, and he’s married to Laura.

00:01:13.599 --> 00:01:14.769
<v><b>Julia:</b></v> Laura?

00:01:16.235 --> 00:01:18.725
From our class? Really?

00:01:19.345 --> 00:01:19.792
<v><b>Sarah:</b></v> Yes!

00:01:24.886 --> 00:01:26.284
<v><b>Julia:</b></v> Is that her?

00:01:27.181 --> 00:01:27.928
<v><b>Sarah:</b></v> Yes.

00:01:30.853 --> 00:01:32.833
That’s her, with Matt!

00:01:37.309 --> 00:01:39.701
<v><b>Julia:</b></v> Very ugly shoes.

00:01:40.088 --> 00:01:41.720
<v><b>Sarah:</b></v> Yes, horrible.

00:01:44.609 --> 00:01:46.160
<v><b>Laura:</b></v> Sarah, hi!

00:01:46.713 --> 00:01:47.900
Great to see you again!

00:01:48.565 --> 00:01:49.459
<v><b>Sarah:</b></v> Laura?

00:01:50.443 --> 00:01:52.529
<v><b>Laura:</b></v> Oh, and Julia.

00:01:53.294 --> 00:01:54.380
<v><b>Julia:</b></v> Yes, er …

00:01:54.855 --> 00:01:58.477
Hi, Laura. Great photos.

00:01:58.859 --> 00:02:01.405
<v><b>Laura:</b></v> What? Oh, yes.

00:02:02.051 --> 00:02:03.264
Good party.

00:02:04.377 --> 00:02:06.765
<v><b>Julia:</b></v> I love your shoes.

00:02:12.432 --> 00:02:13.279
They’re beautiful.